    "body": "> 链接基本都这样 比特彗星 谢谢\r\n\r\n装bitcomet装了好久。\r\nFailed to decode tracker response.\r\n个人感觉是你所处的网络环境链接github不畅。\r\n如果你是在国内用的话，建议使用缓存加速的接口。\r\n```text\r\n[RAW]\r\nhttps://at.raxianch.moe/?type=AT-best\r\nhttps://at.raxianch.moe/?type=AT-all\r\nhttps://at.raxianch.moe/?type=AT-all-udp\r\nhttps://at.raxianch.moe/?type=AT-all-http\r\nhttps://at.raxianch.moe/?type=AT-all-https\r\nhttps://at.raxianch.moe/?type=AT-all-ws\r\nhttps://at.raxianch.moe/?type=AT-best-ip\r\nhttps://at.raxianch.moe/?type=AT-all-ip\r\n```\r\n这是我用bitcomet测试的图片。\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/18726905/103099589-147a0f80-464a-11eb-904a-941f3c3b77ad.png)\r\ntrackers更新没问题。\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/18726905/103099612-2d82c080-464a-11eb-9a56-61787269f1a8.png)\r\n下载情况也OK。\r\n",
